LICENSE SCOPE

The authors' original synthetic research datasets, CSV/MAT numerical records,
and author-created dataset documentation in this repository are made available
under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License (CC BY 4.0),
subject to the authors holding the rights needed to license those materials.
This grant applies to author-owned material under:
  - data/    (numerical research datasets and audit tables)
  - docs/    (author-written dataset and reproducibility documentation)
  - README.md and data descriptions in this repository

Attribution for the licensed materials:
